<title>SWEDEN: Stena AB unit wins $650 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Stena AB unit wins $650 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stena Tay Ltd of Bermuda, part of privately owned Swedish group Stena AB, said on Monday it won a drilling contract from Shell International Petroleum Company Ltd worth $650 million over 10 years.</p>
<p>Stena AB owns part of Swedish international shipping operator Stena Line AB.</p>
</text>
